          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How well do Bulletproof nets last over time?",
            "answer": "<p>The Net Return’s Bulletproof nets are built to last, thanks to their construction with Dyneema, the best golf net material for high-impact use. They are engineered for practice golf net durability, making them suitable for frequent and prolonged sessions. Whether you’re using them at home or in a high-traffic commercial environment, they maintain their strength and integrity over time. Backed by an industry-leading 5-year warranty, these nets represent the gold standard in durable golf practice nets for long-term performance.</p>"
